# KaidokuAvoid AI Project Guide

## Architecture
- Framework: Expo SDK 52 plus React Native (TypeScript)
- Navigation: Expo Router (file-based, in app/ directory)
- State: Local via hooks plus AsyncStorage
- Styling: StyleSheet (dark theme, LINE-inspired palette)

## Key Files
- app/_layout.tsx: Root Stack navigator
- app/index.tsx: Home situation picker
- app/compose.tsx: Compose conversation input and options
- app/result.tsx: Result AI response with chat bubbles
- app/settings.tsx: Settings API key, IAP, usage

## Services
- src/services/openai.ts: OpenAI Responses API wrapper (gpt-4o-mini)
- src/services/storage.ts: AsyncStorage plus SecureStore helpers
- src/services/iap.ts: In-App Purchase (react-native-iap)
- src/services/aiCheck.ts: AI smell check heuristics

## Rules
- All UI text in Japanese
- Reply limits: best 60 chars, backup 70 chars, NG 50 chars
- Free: 5 lifetime uses; Paid: 200/month (reset on calendar month)
- API key stored in SecureStore (dev only); proxy planned for production
- No photos, icons or emojis only
